Drill #1: Around the World Throwing
Purpose
How it Works
The main purpose of this drill is to work on the throws that
infielders will be required to make during a game. The catcher
will be able to work on throws down to second and third, the
middle infielders will work on turning two, and the corner
infielders will work on throws home and across the diamond.
